{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b5b27bbe-4300-8fd1-b8a0-54d140afb4f3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T12:04:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. Bottom line, the trash truck broke my bin this morning. The lid's snapped right off and there's a crack down the side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Let me get your information. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:03:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "99 Annandale Road, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "99 Annandale Road. And it was the truck that damaged it, you said, lid broken off and a crack in the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. I saw it happen, the arm dropped it hard. [line breaks up] Sorry, I'm on speaker. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got you. I'll put in a request for a replacement bin. Is the best number 401-555-0159?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Someone will follow up about the bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And when's my next pickup? I'm just trying to figure out if I can wait or need to borrow a can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For Annandale Road, I'd say it's next Monday, but let me check the schedule for the holiday week. [pause] Yes, it's Monday the fifth, regular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'll put it in a box till then. I've got a cash envelope system for groceries, so I'm not buying a new bin if the city's replacing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, you shouldn't have to. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    }
  ],
